# Rule-scoped global-state waivers.
# Format:
#   <rule-id> <path-glob> <reason>
#
# These entries waive only the named rule for the named path. They are not
# file-wide exemptions. Rule ids are listed in scripts/ban-globals.sh.

thread-local crates/warp-wasm/src/lib.rs WASM boundary: exports are free functions that need a module-scoped kernel. Single-threaded WASM has no alternative.
static-interior crates/warp-wasm/src/lib.rs the module-scoped kernel cell declared inside that thread_local block.
once-lock crates/warp-core/src/external_action.rs immutable table of empty-subtree hashes, derived from constants by a pure function; first use cannot change its value.
thread-local crates/warp-core/src/causal_wal.rs diagnostic recovery work counter; not admission authority. To be replaced by an owned counter: issue #801.
static-interior crates/warp-core/src/causal_wal.rs the cell of that diagnostic counter: issue #801.
static-interior crates/warp-core/src/causal_wal_tests.rs test-only counter that names unique temporary directories.
static-interior crates/warp-core/tests/* test-only counters for unique temporary directories and callback call counts, with one lock that serializes the callback tests; never linked into the runtime.
